WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Welcome to Care Payments Group.

2
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:03.650
We look forward to your training.

3
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.950
Before we meet, please take your terminal
out of the box,

4
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.500
turn it on, and connect it to Wi-Fi.

5
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.550
The setup video and portal login
are linked below.

6
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:15.350
Use the email address listed
to access your portal,

7
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:19.300
and look for the Notify Valor POS email
to create your password.

8
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.550
Can’t find it or access that email?

9
00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:22.600
No problem.

10
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.300
We’ll help you get set up together on the call.

11
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.800
Thanks so much for choosing Care Payments Group.

12
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.600
We look forward to seeing you on your training call!
